# In .env.local, add the standard OpenAI server key named OPENAI_API_KEY.
# Without it, the guide uses verified portfolio answers.
# OPENAI_MODEL optionally overrides the default model (gpt-5.6-luna, low reasoning).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL optionally sets the canonical site origin used for
# Open Graph image URLs. On Vercel, VERCEL_URL is used automatically.
